17 0 obj
<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Panel A displays a t-SNE plot showing different cell populations identified by color and labeled as Pop 0 to Pop 7. Panel B is a bar chart indicating the frequency of each cell population. Panel C contains heatmaps showing expression levels of various markers across clusters. Panel D is a horizontal bar chart comparing frequency of cell populations between STS and Control groups. Panel E compares frequency across P1, P2, and P3 groups using a horizontal bar chart.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Panel A displays t-SNE plots showing different cell populations, labeled 0 to 7, with a color-coded legend for identification. A bar chart on the right presents frequency data for Total, Ctrl, STS, P1, P2, and P3. Panel B shows a comparative bar graph between STS and Ctrl groups for various cell types, while Panel C offers a similar comparison among P1, P2, and P3.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
